FFIILLEESS
     ${DISTDIR}/distinfo
           a cache of known distfiles with their respective checksums.

     ${DISTDIR}/history
           List of files appearing in _$_{_D_I_S_T_D_I_R_}_/_d_i_s_t_i_n_f_o that seem to no
           longer be required by the ports tree.  dpb(1) will append to this
           file each time it is run on the whole tree (option --aa) and only if
           the ports tree scan finishes without error.  Each line is of the
           form

                 timestamp SHA256 (file) = sha

           denoting the first time a file/sha entry was no longer seen in the
           ports tree.

